    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="High Chaplain Erebus" hidden="true" id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus">
      <rules><rule id="r37-wb-ere-high" name="High Chaplain" hidden="false"><description>Erebus counts as both a Legion Chaplain Consul and a Diabolist for all Word Bearers rules, construction requirements and Rites. He fulfils The Dark Shepherds and enables Dark Channelling.</description></rule><rule id="r37-wb-ere-croz-rule" name="Master-crafted Accursed Crozius" hidden="false"><description>Uses the normal Accursed Crozius rules and is additionally Master-crafted: re-roll one failed To Hit roll per turn. It grants a 4+ Invulnerable Save and is a Summoning Point.</description></rule><rule id="r37-wb-ere-anath-rule" name="Anathame Dagger" hidden="false"><description>During an Assault phase, exchange one normal Attack for one attack with the dagger. Invulnerable Saves cannot be taken. An unsaved Wound against a non-Vehicle model becomes a Massive Wound (D3). Against Vehicles it has no additional effect.</description></rule><rule id="r37-wb-ere-psy" name="Psyker (Mastery Level 1)" hidden="false"><description>Erebus is a Mastery Level 1 Psyker and has Burning Lore at no additional cost.</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-wb-leg" name="Legiones Astartes (Word Bearers)" targetId="r37-wb-rule-legiones-astartes-word-bearers" type="rule" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-wb-atsknf" name="And They Shall Know No Fear" targetId="r36-shared-and-they-shall-know-no-fear-c9d3c20" type="rule" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-wb-fan" name="Fanatical Devotion" targetId="r37-wb-rule-fanatical-devotion" type="rule" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-independent-character" name="Independent Character" targetId="r36-shared-independent-character-4fbd2ae" type="rule" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-master-of-the-legion" name="Master of the Legion" targetId="r36-shared-master-of-the-legion-a3a88da" type="rule" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r37-wb-ere-croz" name="Master-crafted Accursed Crozius" targetId="r37-wb-prof-crozius" type="profile" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-master-crafted" name="Master-Crafted" targetId="r36-shared-master-crafted-30feea6" type="rule" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r37-wb-ere-anath" name="Anathame Dagger" targetId="r37-wb-prof-anathame" type="profile" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r38-r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-burning" name="Burning Lore" targetId="r38-wb-shared-burning-lore" type="rule" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r38-wb-ere-crozius-rule" name="Accursed Crozius" targetId="r38-wb-shared-accursed-crozius" type="rule" hidden="false" /></infoLinks><costs>
        <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="195" />
      </costs>
