                              <characteristics>
                                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="ranged-range">24"</characteristic>
                                <characteristic name="S" typeId="ranged-s">—</characteristic>
                                <characteristic name="AP" typeId="ranged-ap">—</characteristic>
                                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="ranged-type">Blessing</characteristic>
                              </characteristics>
                            </profile>
                          </profiles>
                          <rules>
                            <rule id="r37-wb-kor-powers-p-biomancy-endurance-r61-librarian-power2-biomancy-endurance-rule" name="Endurance" hidden="false">
                              <description>Target friendly unit gains Eternal Warrior, Feel No Pain (5+) and Relentless.

Relentless: Model may move and fire Heavy, Ordnance, Salvo or Rapid Fire weapons as if it remained stationary. It may still charge even after firing such weapons.
Eternal Warrior: Immune to Instant Death / Massive Wounds. The model suffers 1 Wound instead of D3 Wounds.</description>
                            </rule>
                          </rules>
