                              <description>Roll D6: 1-2 the unit takes a Pinning test; 3-4 it suffers -1 WS, BS, Initiative and Attacks; 5-6 randomly select a model, which takes one hit for every other model in the unit at Strength equal to the unit's majority Strength.</description>
